OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke explores the
OL,9,     Fenduring appeal and satirical bite
OL,10,     Fof Jonathan Swift's 1726 novel.
OL,11,G1500 Gulliver's Travels
OL,12,     F2/2. Rescued from the waves to the
OL,13,     Ffloating island of Laputa,
OL,14,     FGulliver continues his adventures
OL,15,     Fdiscovering impractical innovators
OL,16,     Fand the seemingly perfect
OL,17,     FHouyhnhnms.
