OL,5,G1700 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 2007, an abandoned photo album
OL,7,     Frevealed the chilling normality of
OL,8,     Flife at the Nazi concentration
OL,9,     Fcamp, Auschwitz. Among those
OL,10,     Fpictured is Josef Mengele, the
OL,11,     FAngel of Death.
